<section class="section faq" id="support">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Answers before checkout</h2>
    <p>Clear delivery, returns, and bundle guidance reduces hesitation before shoppers reach the cart.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-grid">
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details open><summary>When does free UK mainland shipping apply?</summary><p>Orders over GBP150 qualify for free UK mainland shipping. The cart and checkout remain the source of truth for final shipping eligibility.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do bundle discounts apply automatically?</summary><p>Yes, when a bundle or automatic discount has been configured in Shopify and the cart meets the offer rules. We avoid showing fake discounts that checkout cannot honor.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I buy without creating an account?</summary><p>Yes. Shopify checkout supports guest checkout, so customers can complete an order without a store membership.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I choose the wrong item?</summary><p>Returns are handled before checkout with clear policy messaging. Contact support for help choosing the right size, routine, or replacement product.</p></details>
    </div>
    <aside class="support-card" aria-label="Support prompt">
      <span>Need help choosing?</span>
      <strong>Tell us your pet, routine, and problem to solve.</strong>
      <p>We can point you toward cleaning, walking, feeding, or daily-care products before you buy.</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:support@activepaw.co.uk">Ask support</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "FAQ accordion", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ accordion" }] }
{% endschema %}
